<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Indosat sets up multimedia arm.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Indosat sets up multimedia arm.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian telecommunication firm PT Indosat said on Friday it had set up PT Indosat Mega Media as the holding company for its multi-media investment.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the paid-up capital for the firm was 50 billion rupiah. It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
